# Code owners (docs/architecture-guardrails.md). A pull request that touches a path below requests review from its
# owner; with "Require review from Code Owners" on in the branch ruleset, it cannot merge without that approval.
# Later lines win over earlier ones for the same path.
# Either owner's approval satisfies the rule; @cm-ai-ops-bot is listed so the bots can keep work moving without
# Jeffrey approving each pull request himself.

